  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion with imagenet_vit_l image encoder achieve high accuracy (config_039: 0.725). This experiment tests whether using pca_n2000 RNA encoder (instead of scvi_n200) with the same image encoder, aggregation, and fusion settings isolates the impact of RNA representation. It directly addresses uncertainty about RNA encoder choice while keeping other critical factors constant, providing clear insights with minimal design changes."
}

